      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040202,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽广播",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“嗯嗯嗯～，是谁把本大爷叫出来的啊～？”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402020150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040202018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040202,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团电姬粉丝们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呀啊啊啊。等下等下真的假的一上来就这样？心脏要停啦！？/n叶羽魔神亲！？好可爱啊啊啊。是我是我，叫你的是我啊啊啊！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402020160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040202019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040202,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽广播",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“来来来，今晚也将开启奇妙、欢乐又令人心跳不已的梦幻故事！/n　聚集在电姬空间的各位，当然已经准备好了吧？”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402020170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040202020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040202,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团电姬粉丝们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "好——！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402020180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040202021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040202,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽广播",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“很好，那就跟上我！/n　欢迎来到一千零一夜的世界――”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402020190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
